    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the ability to breathe underwater, and your Swim Speed doubles. You always have the Tsunami spell prepared. You can also expend a use of Channel Divinity to cast it without expending a spell slot. Aldyhn grants wisdom, Vani grants courage, and Thonir grants storms. The trick is knowing which blessing you’ve received. —Cranhath Antonsson, Grimfolk Jarl</p><ul><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.323937a434b95ce6]{Tsunami}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.baba7f4a5e0eee5e]{Tsunami — Channel Divinity}</li></ul>"
